{"availability":"available","full":"soanseng/the-lin","name":"the-lin","description":"林宅血案互動歷史網站 — 以政府解密報告為基礎的沉浸式敘事體驗 | Interactive history site on the 1980 Lin family massacre, built from declassified government reports","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":14,"forks":2,"created":"2026-02-09T05:49:45Z","updated":"2026-02-20T14:21:12Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://soanseng.github.io/the-lin/","topics":["github-pages","history","human-rights","interactive-storytelling","react","scrollytelling","taiwan","transitional-justice","typescript","white-terror"],"demo":"https://soanseng.github.io/the-lin/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T22:39:49.060Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T22:39:49.060Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T22:39:49.060Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-12T02:04:24.041Z","stars":13,"forks":2},{"at":"2026-10-17T22:39:49.060Z","stars":14,"forks":2}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["民國六十九年二月二十八日——二二八事件三十三週年紀念日，也是美麗島軍事大審首次公開審理之日。","就在這一天，在情治機關的嚴密監控之下，省議員林義雄的母親林游阿妹遭利刃刺殺身亡，七歲的雙胞胎女兒林亮均、林亭均同遭殺害。長女林奐均身中數刀，重傷倖存。兇手在林宅逗留長達八十分鐘，全身而退。","這不是一起普通的兇殺案。這是一場在國家監控體系的注視下發生的政治謀殺——四個情治機關同時監聽林宅電話、裝設竊聽器、派駐監視人員，卻在案發當天集體「消失」。事後，關鍵的電話監聽錄音帶遭銷毀，嫌犯畫像被攔截，偵查線索被刻意引向錯誤方向。"],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/soanseng/the-lin/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"c2d42b52384221a27e091342b692311cd58079cf6c4bb8d66d99b63dbd2c0eb4","extractedAt":"2026-10-12T02:04:24.181Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T02:04:24.181Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"民國六十九年二月二十八日——二二八事件三十三週年紀念日，也是美麗島軍事大審首次公開審理之日。","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/soanseng/the-lin/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"c2d42b52384221a27e091342b692311cd58079cf6c4bb8d66d99b63dbd2c0eb4","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/soanseng/the-lin/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T02:04:24.181Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-02-20T14:21:12Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","s